  - text: a sacred or culturally central narrative
    attribution: John Baines, Egyptologist, on the basic definition of myth
    section: definition-and-scope
  - text: not a shred of evidence that a specific kind of 'unorthodox' mythology
      was coined... for this genre.
    attribution: J. F. Borghouts, on magical texts
    section: origins
